# FTP-ready trees (CMake copies the RPX; generate_title_xml.py writes XML).
Release/*
!Release/README.md

# Generated Cafe title XML copies next to each title (Release/ is the output).
# Sample catalogs in content/ stay in git.
**/code/
**/meta/

